# Book categories

A book category is one label. It has no parent and no children. Do not store it in `course_categories` or `content_nodes`.

A book has at most one `category_id`. Setting a new `category_id` replaces the previous one. Null clears the placement. There is no `category_position` on a book.

`DELETE` of a category is `BOOK_DELETE` only. A category that still has a book returns `409` `CATEGORY_NOT_EMPTY`. A `parentId` on a book category returns `400` `VALIDATION_FAILED`. A taken category position returns `409` `CATEGORY_POSITION_TAKEN`.

Student catalog book routes stay unchanged. This follow-on does not add a category filter there.
